      <div class="description">
        <h2 class="place-details-title">About The Place</h2>
        <p>
          The Padmaja Naidu Himalayan Zoological Park is renowned for its
          conservation efforts and is home to endangered species like the red
          panda and snow leopard. Located in the heart of Darjeeling, this
          high-altitude zoo offers a scenic view of the Eastern Himalayas and
          educates visitors about Himalayan wildlife.
